          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kopie löschen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete “%@”?" : {
      "comment" : "Question before a slideshow that only exists as its copy is deleted; %@ is the slideshow name",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ löschen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "comment" : "Closes the help screen and the slideshow settings",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every slideshow you start appears on the start screen and plays again with one tap. A folder or an album plays straight from Files or Photos, so it always shows what is in there now. Choosing the same folder or album again opens its slideshow instead of adding a second one. Use the pencil to rename a slideshow and the bin to delete it." : {
      "comment" : "Help text",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Diashow, die du startest, erscheint auf der Startseite und läuft mit einem Tipp wieder an. Ein Ordner oder ein Album wird direkt aus Dateien bzw. Fotos abgespielt und zeigt deshalb immer, was gerade darin ist. Wählst du denselben Ordner oder dasselbe Album noch einmal, öffnet sich seine Diashow, statt eine zweite anzulegen. Mit dem Stift benennst du eine Diashow um, mit dem Papierkorb löschst du sie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fade between images" : {
      "comment" : "Setting",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item: pick image files from the Files app",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dateien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill screen" : {
      "comment" : "Setting",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bildschirm füllen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label of the ? button",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hilfe"
